                "loc": "MRK.14.32+MRK.14.33+MRK.14.34+MRK.14.35+MRK.14.36+MRK.14.37+MRK.14.38+MRK.14.39+MRK.14.40+MRK.14.41+MRK.14.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 14.32-42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.22.39+LUK.22.40+LUK.22.41+LUK.22.42+LUK.22.43+LUK.22.44+LUK.22.45+LUK.22.46"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 22.39-46",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore too nkolong'i enyena o sesen etoomonuo Yesu esaisho, nebuaku oleng too lkiyio, esai ilo apa oidim aitajeu te nkeeya, netoning'oki ninye te nkaraki naure ninye Enkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore hoo naa Oinoti ninye, eitamoo kewan enkirukoto te ina mion nanoto, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa ore amu eitabayioki, etaa ninye enjeunoto oo ntarasi te lelo pooki ooning ninye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neitaa Enkai ninye olapolosani kitok to lkerreti le Melkisedek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkikoo naipirta eanyata enkirukoto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te na bae keetae nkumok naaji naagol elimunoto, amu eijo ketagolo intae ilukuny mining'ung'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.3.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ilkor 3.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Amu ore aa intae napaji taata ilaiteng'enak, neton eiririkino te nelotu likae aigilie intae nkiterunot o rorei le Enkai. Eton aa kule naairirikino intae, mme endaa nagol; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amu ore pooki ng'ae laa kule ake eishuyie naa alani to rorei le supatisho, amu eton aa enkerai ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore endaa nagol naa enoo ltung'ana botoro, ene lelo ooiteng'enaki to lmoo metayiolo aatirishu isupati o ntorrok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
